SUMMARY:Free Community Laundry Event
DESCRIPTION:Join the Uplift Laundry Truck for a free community laundry event on June 20\, 11:00-2:00pm\, at the Wash House. \nParticipants will receive a $10 pre-loaded laundry card and free detergent while supplies last. Personal hygiene items and other community resources will also be available. This initiative aims to support families and individuals facing financial or housing challenges by providing a welcoming environment to access essential laundry services. \nRegister here. \n  \n  \n 
URL:https://resilientdurhamnc.org/event/free-community-laundry-event/
LOCATION:The Wash House\, 2000 Chapel Hill Road\, Durham\, NC\, 27707\, United States
END:VEVENT
